  "description": "Pangea: The Ultimate Global Touring Bike\nNo matter where the road takes you, the Pangea is ready for the journey. Whether you're navigating the streets of Timbuktu or cruising through Texas, this bike is built for the long haul. As the original global touring bike, the Pangea’s rugged 26\" wheel format ensures you’ll find tires and tubes, even in the most remote regions.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 26\" Wheels: Designed for 45mm–55mm tires, providing versatility and durability on any surface or terrain.\n\nRugged Reynolds 725 Steel Tubing: Tough and reliable, featuring an integrated chainstay yoke for strength and long-lasting performance.\n\nSteel Uni-Crown Touring Fork: Designed for precise handling, even with a fully-loaded bike.\n\nProven Co-Motion Touring Geometry: Engineered for comfort and stability over long distances, ensuring a smooth ride.\n\nRack, Fender, and Bottle Mounts: Equipped with all the mounts you need for gear, with three bottle mounts for ample hydration.\n\nMechanical Disc Brakes and Hand-Built Wheels: Reliable stopping power and rugged wheels for any terrain you encounter.\n\nCustomizable Drivetrain Options:\n\nShimano Ultegra 2x11 kit for versatile gearing\nRohloff internal hub for low-maintenance performance\nPinion gearbox for rugged, precision shifting...even more awesome with smart shifting!\n\nHandlebar Options:\n\nRoad drop bars for a racing feel\nMountain/trekking handlebars for comfort on long tours\n\nThe Pangea is the bike you can trust to take you anywhere on the globe. Tough, reliable, and ready to handle your gear, it’s the ultimate companion for world travelers.\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion Pangea order started!",
